For women evaluating a potential husband: Does he pursue God personally without you pushing?
{red|Does he take initiative spiritually in your relationship?}
{red|Could you follow his spiritual direction? For men preparing for leadership: Are you growing in your own faith consistently?}
{red|Do you take initiative spiritually, or wait for others?}
{red|Are you developing the character to lead a family spiritually?}
